# Task: Explore Quiki_Design Figma and Capture Screenshots

## Plan
1. [ ] Take initial screenshot and get DOM.
2. [ ] Zoom to fit (Shift+1) to see all frames.
3. [ ] Identify and list all frames/screens.
4. [ ] For each frame:
    - [ ] Zoom to the frame.
    - [ ] Take a screenshot.
    - [ ] Analyze and record UI details (name, elements, colors, fonts, layout).
5. [ ] Provide a final detailed summary.

