## Screen Details

### 1. Login Screen
- **Name**: login
- **Layout**: Single column, centered elements.
- **UI Elements**:
    - Header: "Sign In"
    - Inputs: "Enter your email", "Enter your password" (with eye icon).
    - Button: "Login" (Dark brown background, white text).
    - Links: "Don't have an account? Sign Up", "Continue as Guest".
    - Social: "Continue with Google", "Continue with Apple", "Continue with Facebook" (icons with text).
- **Styling**: Minimalist, white background, rounded corners on inputs and buttons. Dark brown primary accent color.

### 3. Set New Password Screen
- **Name**: . (labeled as "Set a new password")
- **Layout**: Single column.
- **UI Elements**:
    - Header: "Set a new password"
    - Subtext: "Your new password must be different from previous used passwords."
    - Inputs: "Password", "Confirm Password" (with eye icons).
    - Button: "Update Password" (Dark brown).
- **Styling**: Consistent with the design system.

### 4. Profile Screen
- **Name**: Profile
- **Layout**: Single column with scrollable content.
- **UI Elements**:
    - Header: "Profile" with Back icon.
    - Profile Picture: Circular image with edit icon.
    - Fields: Full Name, Email, Phone Number, Address, Country, Date of Birth.
    - Button: "Update" or "Save" at the bottom.
- **Styling**: Rounded input fields, dark brown accent.

### 5. My Cart Screen
- **Name**: My Cart
- **Layout**: List with summary at the bottom.
- **UI Elements**:
    - List of products: Item image, Title (e.g., Chocolate Cake), Category, Price, and Quantity selector.
    - Swipe-to-delete action on items.
    - "Promo Code" input field with "Apply" button.
    - Order summary: Sub-total, Delivery Fee, Discount, and Total Cost.
    - Button: "Proceed to Checkout" (Dark brown).
- **Styling**: Card-based layout for items.

### 6. Checkout Screen
- **Name**: Checkout
- **Layout**: Sectioned details.
- **UI Elements**:
    - Header: "Checkout".
    - Shipping Address: Displays current address with a "CHANGE" button.
    - Order List: Compact list of items.
    - Button: "Continue to Payment" (Dark brown).
- **Styling**: Minimalist icons and clear section headers.

### 7. Shipping Address Screen
- **Name**: Shipping Address
- **Layout**: List of addresses.
- **UI Elements**:
    - List: Home, Office, Parent's House, etc. with full addresses.
    - Icons for each category (house, briefcase).
    - Radio buttons for selection.
    - Button: "Add New Shipping Address" (Dashed border).
    - Primary Button: "Apply" (Dark brown).
- **Styling**: Consistent with the design system, clean list items.

### 8. Payment Method Screen
- **Name**: Payment Method
- **Layout**: Categorized list with a balance display.
- **UI Elements**:
    - Wallet section with current balance.
    - Credit/Debit Card section with an "Add card" option.
    - Other methods: PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay.
    - Primary Button: "Confirm Payment".
- **Styling**: Uses icons for each payment type, consistent dark brown button.

### 9. Add Card Screen
- **Name**: Add Card
- **Layout**: Form with a visual card preview.
- **UI Elements**:
    - Visual card showing chip, number, holder name, and expiry date.
    - Input fields: Holder Name, Card Number, Expiry, CVV.
    - Checkbox: "Save Card".
    - Primary Button: "Add Card".
- **Styling**: Card preview has a dark brown gradient/solid color.

### 10. Home / Discover Screen
- **Name**: Home
- **Layout**: Header with location, search bar, category icons, and product grid.
- **UI Elements**:
    - Header: Location picker ("New York, USA") and notification bell.
    - Search Bar: "Search for cakes, desserts...".
    - Banner: Promotional offer ("30% Off").
    - Categories: Horizontal scrollable icons (All, Cakes, Cupcakes, etc.).
    - Product Grid: Cards with image, title, category, price, and rating.
    - Navigation Bar: Home, Search, Orders, Profile.

### 11. Product Detail Screen
- **Name**: Product Detail
- **Layout**: Large image on top, details below.
- **UI Elements**:
    - Product Image with Back and Favorite buttons.
    - Title (e.g., Chocolate Cake) and Category.
    - Rating (4.5).
    - Description text.
    - Size selection (Regular, Large).
    - Quantity selector (- / +).
    - Primary Button: "Add to Cart" with Price display.

### 12. Track Order Screen
- **Name**: Track Order
- **Layout**: Timeline-based status tracking.
- **UI Elements**:
    - Header: "Track Order".
    - Visual Timeline: Order Placed, In Progress, In Transit, Delivered.
    - Status details with timestamps.
    - Delivery Address display.
    - Order Summary: Compact list of items and Total.
- **Styling**: Uses status icons (checkmarks, clock, truck).
